      description: "Constructed by Voxgig from Gandi's public API documentation (https://api.gandi.net/docs/), retrieved 2026-11-18T12:39:33Z. Gandi publishes no OpenAPI definition, and this is not an official Gandi document. It aims at the whole documented v5 API: 221 operations on 126 paths across the 12 documented API sections. It carries interface facts only: paths, methods, parameter and property names, types, enums, defaults, constraints, media types, status codes and the bearer scheme. Gandi's descriptions and examples are not reproduced; each operation links to the section of Gandi's documentation that describes it. The operationIds are the documentation's own anchors. The Email API is marked deprecated, as the documentation marks it."
